#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""agent_coord: one coordinator per OS user for the agent sessions on this host.

Layers, top to bottom:
  clients      per-client adapters (Claude Code / Codex / Antigravity / plain CLI): identity,
               hook payload parsing, hook output shape and the wake channel
  Coordinator  lock + git facts resolved outside the lock + Journal write-through +
               post-commit fan-out to stream subscribers and the wake thread
  Ledger       pure in-memory state and every rule (sessions, per-recipient deliveries,
               resources, requests, replay records); no I/O, injected clock
  Journal      SQLite: write-through of changed rows, full reload at start / rollback
  transport    newline JSON-RPC over a Unix socket; Client; MCP stdio adapter; hooks; CLI
"""

